Subject: [PATCH] Add /gkickall command


diff --git a/module/cmd-kick/src/main/java/com/mickey42302/waterfallctd/module/cmd/kick/CommandKickAll.java b/module/cmd-kick/src/main/java/com/mickey42302/waterfallctd/module/cmd/kick/CommandKickAll.java
